        "Content": "Off-street parking\r\nSeveral living areas throughout\r\nSuperb location with excellent connectivity to the South link road network, and Cork city centre\r\nWalking distance of local amenities – supermarkets, bars, shops, sports clubs\r\nExcellent first-time buy or investment opportunity – no rental history\r\nExtended to the rear \r\nApprox. 30-minute stroll to\r\nCork city centre"
